{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is visible, approach it. If not, scan area. Grab object, do task and move to destination.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveRobotToDestination    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
